## Navigation (GoRouter)

- Single router: `appRouter` in `lib/core/router/router.dart`
- Route paths: `RouteNames` constants in `route_names.dart` — never hardcode path strings except movie detail URLs
- **Shell tabs** (`StatefulShellRoute.indexedStack`): Home `/`, Watchlist `/watchlist`, Profile `/profile`
- **Outside shell** (no bottom nav): login, register, verify-email, splash, movie detail
- Full-screen pushes use `parentNavigatorKey: _rootNavigatorKey` in router config

### Navigation patterns

```dart
// Auth flows
context.push(RouteNames.login);
context.go(RouteNames.home);
context.go(RouteNames.verifyEmail, extra: email);

// Nested recommendation results (under home)
context.go('/${RouteNames.recommendations}', extra: {'mood': mood, 'time': minutes});

// Movie detail (root navigator)
context.push('/${RouteNames.movieDetail}/${movie.id}');

// After login from modal: pop with result
context.pop(true);
```

- Use `context.canPop()` before `pop()`; fall back to `context.go(RouteNames.home)` when no stack
- **Auth gating is UI-level**, not router redirects: show `LoginRequiredView` or `VerificationRequiredView` inside protected screens

---

## State Management

- **Local UI state:** `StatefulWidget` + `setState` (forms, loading flags, selections)
- **Firebase auth:** `StreamBuilder` on `safeAuthStateChanges()` from `firebase_safe.dart`
- **Firestore watchlist:** `StreamBuilder` on `WatchlistService().watchlistStream()`
- **One-shot async (movie detail):** `FutureBuilder` or `late Future` in `initState`
- Always check `mounted` before `setState` or `context` use after `await`

